                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This was a great starting point for a series. The game is very trippy and surreal. I loved the character design, as well as the environments. The dialogue was odd in a good way, and there was a lot of beautiful and trippy art for you to see. For a free game it sets up a lot of story and lore for a continuation into this universe. I already have purchased his other games, so this got me super excited to boot them up and get back into this weird world.",
